SIGPROBE predicate=b2
  1 power-on, no control write at all                   - 
  2 libata steady 0x08 (NO reset requested)             - 
  3a OpenBSD SRST asserted (0x06)                       - 
  3b OpenBSD SRST released (0x08)                      SIG
  4a libata SRST asserted (0x0c)                        - 
  4b libata SRST released (0x08)                       SIG
  5a after a command, before any control write          - 
  5b after a command + ROUTINE 0x08 ctl write           - 
  6 nIEN only (0x02)                                    - 
  7 0x00 written, nothing ever asserted                 - 
